OL2", "label": "Enterprises have document(s) on measures, practices or procedures on ICT security"}, {"code": "E_SECAWVTGI", "label": "Enterprises make persons employed aware of their obligations in ICT security related issues by voluntary training or internally available information (e.g. information on the intranet)"}, {"code": "E_SECAWCTP", "label": "Enterprises make persons employed aware of their obligations in ICT security related issues by compulsory training courses or viewing compulsory material"}, {"code": "E_SECAWCONT", "label": "Enterprises make persons employed aware of their obligations in ICT security related issues by contract (e.g. contract of employment)"}, {"code": "E_SECAWANY", "label": "Enterprises make persons employed aware of their obligations in ICT security related issues"}, {"code": "E_SECAWNONE", "label": "Enterprises don't make persons employed aware of their obligations in ICT security related issues"}, {"code": "E_ITSEC3OWN", "label": "The ICT security related activities are carried out by the own employees"}, {"code": "E_ITSEC3EXT", "label": "The ICT security related activities are carried out by external suppliers"}, {"code": "E_ITSEC3", "label": "The ICT security related activities are carried out by own employees or external suppliers"}, {"code": "E_SECMSMS1", "label": "ICT security measure used: monitoring system used to detect suspicious activity in the ICT systems (e.g. intrusion detection or prevention systems that monitors users\u2019 or devices\u2019 behaviour, network traffic) excluding standalone anti-virus software and default firewall solutions"}, {"code": "E_SECAWANY_POL2", "label": "Enterprises make persons employed aware of their obligations in ICT security related issues and have document(s) on measures, practices or procedures on ICT security"}], "default": "E_SECMSPSW", "has_total": false}, {"id": "unit", "label": "Unit of measure", "options": [{"code": "PC_ENT", "label": "Percentage of enterprises"}, {"code": "PC_E